@silverpoint/fonts
==================

This package redistributes EB Garamond, unmodified from the latin subset built by
Fontsource (@fontsource/eb-garamond 5.3.0):

  files/eb-garamond-latin-400-normal.woff2
  files/eb-garamond-latin-500-normal.woff2
  files/eb-garamond-latin-400-italic.woff2

EB Garamond
Copyright 2017 The EB Garamond Project Authors
(https://github.com/octaviopardo/EBGaramond12).
Original digitisation by Georg Duffner; extended by Octavio Pardo. Based on the roman
of Claude Garamont and the italic of Robert Granjon, from the Berner specimen of 1592.

